cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its datasets, please cite as below."
title: "geno_agent: reproducible corpus, benchmark cohort and RAG pipeline for gene prioritisation in rare Mendelian disease"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible infrastructure for literature-based causal gene prioritisation in
  rare Mendelian disease: a deterministic, version-pinned build recipe for a
  hybrid dense-plus-sparse retrieval index over the genetics-relevant PMC Open
  Access corpus, and a stratified benchmark of 1,047 cases from the GA4GH
  Phenopacket Store carrying per-case annotation-overlap and publication-recency
  metadata. This repository hosts the methods/foundation paper (P1) and the
  system paper (P2) that builds on it.
